guide_check_en = First identify the exact device, firmware/ACPI path or operating-system requirement, then check it against the component documentation. Depends on hardware and macOS; verify before selecting.
guide_avoid_pt = Não instale para Broadcom nem confunda este pacote com driver Wi-Fi Intel.
guide_avoid_en = Do not select merely because the CPU generation or general device category matches. Avoid overlapping patches, alternative drivers, or unsupported macOS releases. For supported Intel Bluetooth controllers (different from Wi-Fi); check IntelBTPatcher and BlueToolFixup when required by macOS.
