guide_avoid_pt = Não instale em desktop e não confunda Kext de bateria com correção obrigatória de EC.
guide_avoid_en = Do not select merely because the CPU generation or general device category matches. Avoid overlapping patches, alternative drivers, or unsupported macOS releases. For laptops requiring battery-level/status reporting via VirtualSMC; EC and ACPI fields may need fixes.
guide_steps_pt = Combine com VirtualSMC e corrija leitura ACPI somente se o diagnóstico da bateria exigir.
guide_steps_en = Identify the hardware using Device Manager hardware IDs or HWiNFO (Windows), lspci/lsusb (Linux), ACPI dumps with SSDTTime/acpidump, or IORegistryExplorer (macOS) as appropriate; check the project README and its version requirements before deciding.
