guide_steps_en = Identify the hardware using Device Manager hardware IDs or HWiNFO (Windows), lspci/lsusb (Linux), ACPI dumps with SSDTTime/acpidump, or IORegistryExplorer (macOS) as appropriate; check the project README and its version requirements before deciding.
