guide_check_en = First identify the exact device, firmware/ACPI path or operating-system requirement, then check it against the component documentation. Proper USB mapping is needed for the applicable setup; the map is machine-specific and cannot be a universal prebuilt file.
guide_avoid_pt = Não instale simultaneamente UTBMap e USBMap para as mesmas portas nem use mapa baixado de outro PC.
guide_avoid_en = Do not select merely because the CPU generation or general device category matches. Avoid overlapping patches, alternative drivers, or unsupported macOS releases. Use only a map generated for your own controller; do not combine it with UTBMap if both manage the same ports.
guide_steps_pt = Teste cada porta USB 2/3, identifique SS/HS e conectores, gere mapa único e teste sleep/wake.
guide_steps_en = Identify the hardware using Device Manager hardware IDs or HWiNFO (Windows), lspci/lsusb (Linux), ACPI dumps with SSDTTime/acpidump, or IORegistryExplorer (macOS) as appropriate; check the project README and its version requirements before deciding.
guide_example_pt = Mapa feito para desktop não funciona necessariamente em notebook da mesma marca.
