guide_example_en = Decision example for VoodooRMI.kext: Requires identification of the touchpad and bus.

[KEXT:voodooi2c]
name = VoodooI2C.kext
description_pt = Controlador base para touchpads e telas de toque conectados por I2C em notebooks.
description_en = Base controller for laptop touchpads and touchscreens connected via I2C.
function_pt = Oferece suporte à controladora I2C para plugins compatíveis com o protocolo do dispositivo.
function_en = Provides I2C-controller support for plugins compatible with the device protocol.
when_pt = Utilizar com plugin correto (HID, ELAN ou outro) quando o hardware realmente utilizar I2C; nem todo notebook usa I2C.
when_en = Use with the proper plugin (HID, ELAN or others) when the device actually uses I2C; not all laptops do.
url = https://github.com/VoodooI2C/VoodooI2C
requirement = conditional
platform = laptop
cpu_vendor = all
requirement_note_pt = Somente dispositivos de entrada I2C compatíveis.
requirement_note_en = Only for compatible I2C input devices.
guide_context_pt = Oferece suporte à controladora I2C para plugins compatíveis com o protocolo do dispositivo. Utilizar com plugin correto (HID, ELAN ou outro) quando o hardware realmente utilizar I2C; nem todo notebook usa I2C.
guide_context_en = Provides I2C-controller support for plugins compatible with the device protocol. Use with the proper plugin (HID, ELAN or others) when the device actually uses I2C; not all laptops do.
guide_check_pt = Identifique barramento I2C pelo Gerenciador de Dispositivos/ACPI, IDs HID e presença de interrupções GPIO.
guide_check_en = First identify the exact device, firmware/ACPI path or operating-system requirement, then check it against the component documentation. Only for compatible I2C input devices.
guide_avoid_pt = Não instale para dispositivo puramente PS/2 ou USB, nem plugins indiscriminados.
guide_avoid_en = Do not select merely because the CPU generation or general device category matches. Avoid overlapping patches, alternative drivers, or unsupported macOS releases. Use with the proper plugin (HID, ELAN or others) when the device actually uses I2C; not all laptops do.
guide_steps_pt = Use VoodooI2C com plugin específico (HID, ELAN etc) conforme dispositivo e confira GPIO.
guide_steps_en = Identify the hardware using Device Manager hardware IDs or HWiNFO (Windows), lspci/lsusb (Linux), ACPI dumps with SSDTTime/acpidump, or IORegistryExplorer (macOS) as appropriate; check the project README and its version requirements before deciding.
guide_example_pt = Reconhecimento do controlador I2C não significa que trackpad já seja acessível.
guide_example_en = Decision example for VoodooI2C.kext: Only for compatible I2C input devices.

