guide_avoid_en = Do not select merely because the CPU generation or general device category matches. Avoid overlapping patches, alternative drivers, or unsupported macOS releases. Advanced use; requires CPUFriendDataProvider configured for CPU and SMBIOS. Avoid generic profiles.
